{"nodes": [{"id": "pedagogy_qat_vs_ptq_figure", "label": "Figure p\u00e9dagogique : QAT vs PTQ \u2014 quand la quantification rencontre l'entra\u00eenement (deux pipelines parall\u00e8les donn\u00e9es\u2192entra\u00eenement\u2192quantification INT8\u2192d\u00e9ploiement ; sch\u00e9ma de principe, aucune donn\u00e9e exp\u00e9rimentale)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "docs/figures/quantization/pedagogy/qat_vs_ptq.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "pedagogy_qat_vs_ptq_qat", "label": "QAT (quantification pendant l'entra\u00eenement) : fake-quant quant\u2192d\u00e9quant ins\u00e9r\u00e9 dans le forward, le gradient voit l'erreur de quantification (STE), export poids INT8 avec scales appris, mod\u00e8le d\u00e9j\u00e0 adapt\u00e9 \u00e0 l'erreur au d\u00e9ploiement", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/figures/quantization/pedagogy/qat_vs_ptq.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "pedagogy_qat_vs_ptq_ptq", "label": "PTQ (quantification apr\u00e8s l'entra\u00eenement) : entra\u00eenement FP32 classique sans voir d'erreur, conversion INT8 apr\u00e8s coup (\u00b1 calibration), le mod\u00e8le d\u00e9couvre l'erreur au d\u00e9ploiement \u2014 sans calibration du scale (legacy 1/128) l'erreur peut \u00eatre destructrice (Sprints 29/36/39)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/figures/quantization/pedagogy/qat_vs_ptq.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "pedagogy_qat_vs_ptq_ste", "label": "Straight-through estimator (STE) : m\u00e9canisme par lequel le gradient traverse l'op\u00e9ration quant\u2192d\u00e9quant et \u00ab voit \u00bb l'erreur de quantification pendant l'entra\u00eenement QAT", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/figures/quantization/pedagogy/qat_vs_ptq.png", "source_location": null, "source_u